{"book": "JHN", "chapter": 19, "lang": "en", "bible": "KJV-2026", "engine": "chatterbox-videos-v1", "durationMs": 349528, "verses": [{"verse": 1, "start": 300, "end": 3177, "text": "Then Pilate therefore took Jesus, and scourged him.", "words": [[0, 300], [5, 448], [12, 888], [22, 1208], [27, 1488], [34, 1908], [38, 2308], [47, 2848]]}, {"verse": 2, "start": 3628, "end": 8898, "text": "And the soldiers platted a crown of thorns, and put it on his head, and they put on him a purple robe,", "words": [[0, 3628], [4, 3753], [8, 3853], [17, 4283], [25, 4713], [27, 4793], [33, 5033], [36, 5193], [44, 5613], [48, 5813], [52, 6013], [55, 6133], [58, 6273], [62, 6413], [68, 6933], [72, 7233], [77, 7353], [81, 7533], [84, 7693], [88, 7873], [90, 7993], [97, 8233]]}, {"verse": 3, "start": 9348, "end": 13697, "text": "And said, Hail, King of the Jews! and they struck him with their hands.", "words": [[0, 9348], [4, 9608], [10, 10312], [16, 10494], [21, 10734], [24, 10894], [28, 10994], [34, 11821], [38, 11960], [43, 12080], [50, 12400], [54, 12660], [59, 12860], [65, 13020]]}, {"verse": 4, "start": 14147, "end": 22311, "text": "Pilate therefore went forth again, and says to them, Behold, I bring him forth to you, that you may know that I find no fault in him.", "words": [[0, 14147], [7, 14569], [17, 14929], [22, 15249], [28, 15569], [35, 16009], [39, 16569], [44, 16789], [47, 17029], [53, 17643], [61, 18198], [63, 18238], [69, 18538], [73, 18738], [79, 19098], [82, 19358], [87, 19858], [92, 20038], [96, 20178], [100, 20338], [105, 20618], [110, 20818], [112, 20958], [117, 21218], [120, 21498], [126, 21838], [129, 22038]]}, {"verse": 5, "start": 22661, "end": 31098, "text": "Then came Jesus forth, wearing the crown of thorns, and the purple robe. And Pilate says to them, Behold the man!", "words": [[0, 22661], [5, 22870], [10, 23190], [16, 23800], [23, 24410], [31, 24810], [35, 25070], [41, 25390], [44, 25570], [52, 26110], [56, 26570], [60, 26730], [67, 26970], [73, 27998], [77, 28347], [84, 28727], [89, 28907], [92, 29127], [98, 29775], [105, 30379], [109, 30639]]}, {"verse": 6, "start": 31448, "end": 43828, "text": "When the chief priests therefore and officers saw him, they cried out, saying, Crucify him, crucify him. Pilate says to them, Take him, and crucify him: for I find no fault in him.", "words": [[0, 31448], [5, 31590], [9, 31690], [15, 31910], [23, 32450], [33, 32990], [37, 33130], [46, 33590], [50, 34050], [55, 34550], [60, 34630], [66, 34910], [71, 35370], [79, 36830], [87, 37310], [92, 37670], [100, 38090], [105, 39009], [112, 39199], [117, 39559], [120, 39859], [126, 40522], [131, 40680], [136, 40900], [140, 41120], [148, 41740], [153, 42336], [157, 42442], [159, 42602], [164, 42742], [167, 43022], [173, 43342], [176, 43542]]}, {"verse": 7, "start": 44178, "end": 50234, "text": "The Jews answered him, We have a law, and by our law he ought to die, because he made himself the Son of God.", "words": [[0, 44178], [4, 44272], [9, 44512], [18, 44932], [23, 45514], [26, 45634], [31, 45794], [33, 45914], [38, 46194], [42, 46654], [45, 46834], [49, 46974], [53, 47234], [56, 47434], [62, 47594], [65, 47734], [70, 48074], [78, 48534], [81, 48734], [86, 48914], [94, 49234], [98, 49434], [102, 49694], [105, 49814]]}, {"verse": 8, "start": 50584, "end": 54255, "text": "¶ When Pilate therefore heard that saying, he was the more afraid;", "words": [[2, 50584], [7, 50728], [14, 51188], [24, 51508], [30, 51848], [35, 52028], [43, 52908], [46, 53088], [50, 53288], [54, 53448], [59, 53648]]}, {"verse": 9, "start": 54705, "end": 61389, "text": "And went again into the judgment hall, and says to Jesus, From where are you? But Jesus gave him no answer.", "words": [[0, 54705], [4, 54849], [9, 55009], [15, 55349], [20, 55629], [24, 55769], [33, 56089], [39, 56529], [43, 56949], [48, 57169], [51, 57369], [58, 58296], [63, 58465], [69, 58685], [73, 58905], [78, 59538], [82, 59726], [88, 60066], [93, 60406], [97, 60606], [100, 60826]]}, {"verse": 10, "start": 61839, "end": 69316, "text": "Then says Pilate to him, Do you not speak to me? do you not know that I have power to crucify you, and have power to release you?", "words": [[0, 61839], [5, 62086], [10, 62416], [17, 62746], [20, 63006], [25, 63563], [28, 63706], [32, 63846], [36, 64006], [42, 64326], [45, 64586], [49, 65224], [52, 65368], [56, 65488], [60, 65708], [65, 65948], [70, 66148], [72, 66288], [77, 66448], [83, 66748], [86, 66928], [94, 67468], [99, 67668], [103, 67888], [108, 68048], [114, 68408], [117, 68608], [125, 68848]]}, {"verse": 11, "start": 69666, "end": 78619, "text": "Jesus answered, You could have no power at all against me, unless it were given you from above: therefore he that delivered me to you has the greater sin.", "words": [[0, 69666], [6, 69943], [16, 70964], [20, 71082], [26, 71222], [31, 71402], [34, 71602], [40, 72002], [43, 72202], [47, 72482], [55, 72862], [59, 73402], [66, 73602], [69, 73802], [74, 73922], [80, 74162], [84, 74382], [89, 74562], [96, 75403], [106, 75922], [109, 76082], [114, 76322], [124, 76622], [127, 76842], [130, 77022], [134, 77262], [138, 77582], [142, 77722], [150, 77982]]}, {"verse": 12, "start": 78969, "end": 90319, "text": "And from then on Pilate sought to release him: but the Jews cried out, saying, If you let this man go, you are not Cæsar’s friend: whoever makes himself a king speaks against Cæsar.", "words": [[0, 78969], [4, 79116], [9, 79296], [14, 79636], [17, 79986], [24, 80336], [31, 80716], [34, 80936], [42, 81216], [47, 81901], [51, 81991], [55, 82131], [60, 82471], [66, 82871], [71, 83331], [79, 84735], [82, 84879], [86, 84979], [90, 85139], [95, 85319], [99, 85499], [103, 86359], [107, 86499], [111, 86579], [115, 86919], [123, 87259], [131, 87999], [139, 88196], [145, 88516], [153, 88836], [155, 89016], [160, 89236], [167, 89536], [175, 89951]]}, {"verse": 13, "start": 90669, "end": 99418, "text": "¶ When Pilate therefore heard that saying, he brought Jesus forth, and sat down in the judgment seat in a place that is called the Pavement, but in the Hebrew, Gabbatha.", "words": [[2, 90669], [7, 90798], [14, 91338], [24, 91638], [30, 91998], [35, 92198], [43, 92938], [46, 93118], [54, 93358], [60, 93698], [67, 94138], [71, 94418], [75, 94658], [80, 94958], [83, 95118], [87, 95218], [96, 95498], [101, 95878], [104, 96078], [106, 96158], [112, 96378], [117, 96578], [120, 96678], [127, 96898], [131, 97058], [141, 97838], [145, 98058], [148, 98178], [152, 98298], [160, 98798]]}, {"verse": 14, "start": 99868, "end": 106852, "text": "And it was the preparation of the passover, and about the sixth hour: and he says to the Jews, Behold your King!", "words": [[0, 99868], [4, 100008], [7, 100088], [11, 100228], [15, 100348], [27, 100908], [30, 101148], [34, 101268], [44, 102208], [48, 102408], [54, 102628], [58, 102848], [64, 103088], [70, 103978], [74, 104121], [77, 104261], [82, 104501], [85, 104721], [89, 104841], [95, 105697], [102, 106122], [107, 106282]]}, {"verse": 15, "start": 107202, "end": 121440, "text": "But they cried out, Away with him, away with him, crucify him. Pilate says to them, Shall I crucify your King? The chief priests answered, We have no king but Cæsar.", "words": [[0, 107202], [4, 107309], [9, 107429], [15, 107709], [20, 109528], [25, 109855], [30, 110135], [35, 110575], [40, 110775], [45, 111095], [50, 111575], [58, 112095], [63, 112919], [70, 113109], [75, 113469], [78, 113769], [84, 114433], [90, 114589], [92, 114729], [100, 115209], [105, 115409], [111, 116163], [115, 116241], [121, 116481], [129, 116801], [139, 119783], [142, 119883], [147, 120103], [150, 120303], [155, 120583], [159, 121028]]}, {"verse": 16, "start": 121790, "end": 128001, "text": "Then delivered he him therefore to them to be crucified. And they took Jesus, and led him away.", "words": [[0, 121790], [5, 122005], [15, 122425], [18, 122705], [22, 122965], [32, 123385], [35, 123665], [40, 123925], [43, 124145], [46, 124265], [57, 125397], [61, 125541], [66, 125641], [71, 125861], [78, 126301], [82, 126621], [86, 126821], [90, 126981]]}, {"verse": 17, "start": 128451, "end": 135213, "text": "And he bearing his cross went forth into a place called the place of a skull, which is called in the Hebrew Golgotha:", "words": [[0, 128451], [4, 128598], [7, 128738], [15, 129058], [19, 129278], [25, 129658], [30, 129938], [36, 130278], [41, 130538], [43, 130738], [49, 130998], [56, 131298], [60, 131518], [66, 131778], [69, 131958], [71, 132078], [78, 132958], [84, 133138], [87, 133318], [94, 133638], [97, 133858], [101, 133958], [108, 134278]]}, {"verse": 18, "start": 135663, "end": 140975, "text": "Where they crucified him, and two other with him, on either side one, and Jesus in the midst.", "words": [[0, 135663], [6, 135772], [11, 135912], [21, 136352], [26, 136772], [30, 137272], [34, 137492], [40, 137712], [45, 137972], [50, 138152], [53, 138412], [60, 138672], [65, 139152], [70, 139372], [74, 139712], [80, 140052], [83, 140372], [87, 140472]]}, {"verse": 19, "start": 141425, "end": 148392, "text": "¶ And Pilate wrote a title, and put it on the cross. And the writing was, JESUS OF NAZARETH THE KING OF THE JEWS.", "words": [[2, 141425], [6, 141663], [13, 141933], [19, 142273], [21, 142373], [28, 142733], [32, 143013], [36, 143213], [39, 143333], [42, 143453], [46, 143553], [53, 144461], [57, 144601], [61, 144681], [69, 145001], [74, 145801], [80, 146261], [83, 146561], [92, 147241], [96, 147301], [101, 147521], [104, 147701], [108, 147801]]}, {"verse": 20, "start": 148842, "end": 157701, "text": "This title then read many of the Jews: for the place where Jesus was crucified was near to the city: and it was written in Hebrew, and Greek, and Latin.", "words": [[0, 148842], [5, 149028], [11, 149408], [16, 149688], [21, 149948], [26, 150268], [29, 150448], [33, 150568], [39, 151437], [43, 151546], [47, 151666], [53, 151886], [59, 152146], [65, 152426], [69, 152746], [79, 153266], [83, 153646], [88, 153846], [91, 153986], [95, 154126], [101, 154914], [105, 155025], [108, 155105], [112, 155245], [120, 155505], [123, 155725], [131, 156085], [135, 156505], [142, 156865], [146, 157145]]}, {"verse": 21, "start": 158151, "end": 167863, "text": "Then said the chief priests of the Jews to Pilate, Write not, The King of the Jews; but that he said, I am King of the Jews.", "words": [[0, 158151], [5, 158333], [10, 158613], [14, 158773], [20, 159013], [28, 159453], [31, 159713], [35, 159813], [40, 160093], [43, 160313], [51, 161374], [57, 161564], [62, 162054], [66, 162134], [71, 162334], [74, 162474], [78, 162799], [84, 163426], [88, 163532], [93, 163812], [96, 163892], [102, 165536], [104, 165863], [107, 166103], [112, 166363], [115, 166523], [119, 166643]]}, {"verse": 22, "start": 168213, "end": 171162, "text": "Pilate answered, What I have written I have written.", "words": [[0, 168355], [7, 168505], [17, 169425], [22, 169567], [24, 169727], [29, 169847], [37, 170367], [39, 170507], [44, 170707]]}, {"verse": 23, "start": 171512, "end": 183994, "text": "¶ Then the soldiers, when they had crucified Jesus, took his garments, and made four parts, to every soldier a part; and also his coat: now the coat was without seam, woven from the top throughout.", "words": [[2, 171512], [7, 171696], [11, 171836], [21, 172176], [26, 172476], [31, 172616], [35, 172716], [45, 173176], [52, 173696], [57, 174316], [61, 174496], [71, 174856], [75, 175456], [80, 175636], [85, 175916], [92, 176396], [95, 176796], [101, 177076], [109, 177473], [111, 177870], [117, 178508], [121, 178655], [126, 178915], [130, 179155], [136, 179966], [140, 180284], [144, 180584], [149, 180884], [153, 181124], [161, 181464], [167, 182324], [173, 182604], [178, 182904], [182, 183044], [186, 183324]]}, {"verse": 24, "start": 184444, "end": 199854, "text": "They said therefore among themselves, Let us not rend it, but cast lots for it, whose it shall be: that the scripture might be fulfilled, which says, They parted my clothing among them, and for my vesture they did cast lots. These things therefore the soldiers did.", "words": [[0, 184444], [5, 184544], [10, 184904], [20, 185384], [26, 185584], [38, 186804], [42, 186980], [45, 187140], [49, 187320], [54, 187620], [58, 187780], [62, 187920], [67, 188280], [72, 188560], [76, 188840], [80, 189180], [86, 189280], [89, 189460], [95, 189640], [99, 190298], [104, 190425], [108, 190545], [118, 190865], [124, 191185], [127, 191365], [138, 192065], [144, 192265], [150, 192845], [155, 193105], [162, 193485], [165, 193645], [174, 193985], [180, 194285], [186, 194765], [190, 195085], [194, 195265], [197, 195445], [205, 195965], [210, 196345], [214, 196565], [219, 196885], [225, 197828], [231, 197976], [238, 198376], [248, 198836], [252, 198916], [261, 199296]]}, {"verse": 25, "start": 200304, "end": 207227, "text": "¶ Now there stood by the cross of Jesus his mother, and his mother’s sister, Mary the wife of Cleophas, and Mary Magdalene.", "words": [[2, 200304], [6, 200480], [12, 200660], [18, 200860], [21, 201120], [25, 201260], [31, 201520], [34, 201700], [40, 202260], [44, 202320], [52, 203020], [56, 203140], [60, 203260], [69, 203680], [77, 204200], [82, 204400], [86, 204580], [91, 204800], [94, 205400], [104, 206000], [108, 206140], [113, 206400]]}, {"verse": 26, "start": 207677, "end": 215634, "text": "When Jesus therefore saw his mother, and the disciple standing by, whom he loved, he says to his mother, Woman, behold your son!", "words": [[0, 207677], [5, 207803], [11, 208043], [21, 208503], [25, 208883], [29, 209063], [37, 209403], [41, 209803], [45, 209923], [54, 210323], [63, 210723], [67, 211443], [72, 211623], [75, 211803], [82, 212663], [85, 212783], [90, 213003], [93, 213183], [97, 213343], [105, 214054], [112, 214501], [119, 214821], [124, 215081]]}, {"verse": 27, "start": 215984, "end": 227565, "text": "Then says he to the disciple, Behold your mother! And from that hour that disciple took her to his own home.", "words": [[0, 215984], [5, 216199], [10, 216519], [13, 216879], [16, 217099], [20, 217219], [30, 218166], [37, 218558], [42, 218738], [48, 222127], [50, 224399], [54, 224521], [59, 224701], [64, 224961], [69, 225231], [74, 225501], [83, 226001], [88, 226321], [92, 226481], [95, 226641], [99, 226821], [103, 227021]]}, {"verse": 28, "start": 228015, "end": 234927, "text": "¶ After this, Jesus knowing that all things were now accomplished, that the scripture might be fulfilled, says, I thirst.", "words": [[2, 228015], [8, 228273], [14, 228613], [20, 228813], [28, 229273], [33, 229533], [37, 229713], [44, 230033], [49, 230273], [53, 230433], [67, 231373], [72, 231633], [76, 231753], [86, 232073], [92, 232373], [95, 232593], [106, 233173], [112, 234042], [114, 234287]]}, {"verse": 29, "start": 235277, "end": 242828, "text": "Now there was set a vessel full of vinegar: and they filled a sponge with vinegar, and put it upon hyssop, and put it to his mouth.", "words": [[0, 235277], [4, 235841], [10, 235921], [14, 236061], [18, 236341], [20, 236461], [27, 236761], [32, 237121], [35, 237261], [44, 238149], [48, 238276], [53, 238416], [60, 238696], [62, 238856], [69, 239176], [74, 239456], [83, 239836], [87, 240396], [91, 240596], [94, 240696], [99, 240976], [107, 241536], [111, 241796], [115, 241976], [118, 242096], [121, 242236], [125, 242376]]}, {"verse": 30, "start": 243278, "end": 250584, "text": "When Jesus therefore had received the vinegar, he said, It is finished: and he bowed his head, and gave up his spirit.", "words": [[0, 243278], [5, 243397], [11, 243877], [21, 244477], [25, 244557], [34, 244917], [38, 245157], [47, 245657], [50, 245737], [56, 246450], [59, 246579], [62, 246719], [72, 247725], [76, 247852], [79, 247992], [85, 248412], [89, 248512], [95, 248852], [99, 249332], [104, 249572], [107, 249772], [111, 249932]]}, {"verse": 31, "start": 251034, "end": 264901, "text": "The Jews therefore, because it was the preparation, that the bodies should not remain upon the cross on the sabbath day, (for that sabbath day was a high day,) besought Pilate that their legs might be broken, and that they might be taken away.", "words": [[0, 251034], [4, 251142], [9, 251482], [20, 252182], [28, 252462], [31, 252642], [35, 252802], [39, 252942], [52, 254122], [57, 254242], [61, 254472], [68, 254702], [75, 255002], [79, 255282], [86, 255582], [91, 255902], [95, 256162], [101, 256502], [104, 256902], [108, 257022], [116, 257362], [121, 258238], [126, 258323], [131, 258483], [139, 258883], [143, 259223], [147, 259403], [149, 259543], [154, 259763], [160, 260583], [169, 260963], [176, 261483], [181, 261663], [187, 261863], [192, 262143], [198, 262403], [201, 262563], [209, 262943], [213, 263403], [218, 263543], [223, 263663], [229, 263863], [232, 264063], [238, 264343]]}, {"verse": 32, "start": 265351, "end": 271138, "text": "Then came the soldiers, and broke the legs of the first, and of the other which was crucified with him.", "words": [[0, 265351], [5, 265539], [10, 265819], [14, 266019], [24, 266959], [28, 267079], [34, 267319], [38, 267559], [43, 267819], [46, 267999], [50, 268119], [57, 268759], [61, 268979], [64, 269119], [68, 269259], [74, 269479], [80, 269739], [84, 269899], [94, 270339], [99, 270739]]}, {"verse": 33, "start": 271588, "end": 277021, "text": "But when they came to Jesus, and saw that he was dead already, they broke not his legs:", "words": [[0, 271588], [4, 271697], [9, 271837], [14, 272017], [19, 272277], [22, 272437], [29, 272877], [33, 273577], [37, 273837], [42, 274017], [45, 274137], [49, 274317], [54, 274537], [63, 275457], [68, 275637], [74, 275917], [78, 276197], [82, 276417]]}, {"verse": 34, "start": 277471, "end": 283514, "text": "But one of the soldiers with a spear pierced his side, and forthwith came there out blood and water.", "words": [[0, 277471], [4, 277634], [8, 277874], [11, 277954], [15, 278114], [24, 278454], [29, 278734], [31, 278854], [37, 279194], [45, 279714], [49, 279834], [55, 280734], [59, 280974], [69, 281554], [74, 281874], [80, 282154], [84, 282394], [90, 282734], [94, 282934]]}, {"verse": 35, "start": 283964, "end": 291025, "text": "And he that saw it bore witness, and his record is true: and he knows that he says true, that you might believe.", "words": [[0, 283964], [4, 284102], [7, 284242], [12, 284422], [16, 284762], [19, 284882], [24, 285122], [33, 285882], [37, 286082], [41, 286222], [48, 286562], [51, 286762], [57, 287614], [61, 287735], [64, 287855], [70, 288135], [75, 288395], [78, 288515], [83, 288715], [89, 289435], [94, 289815], [98, 290015], [104, 290255]]}, {"verse": 36, "start": 291475, "end": 297345, "text": "For these things were done, that the scripture should be fulfilled, A bone of him shall not be broken.", "words": [[0, 291475], [4, 291575], [10, 291775], [17, 292115], [22, 292295], [28, 293035], [33, 293215], [37, 293355], [47, 293695], [54, 294035], [57, 294235], [68, 295315], [70, 295455], [75, 295735], [78, 295895], [82, 296055], [88, 296315], [92, 296535], [95, 296715]]}, {"verse": 37, "start": 297795, "end": 302025, "text": "And again another scripture says, They shall look on him whom they pierced.", "words": [[0, 297795], [4, 297941], [10, 298261], [18, 298501], [28, 298881], [34, 299821], [39, 300021], [45, 300221], [50, 300441], [53, 300701], [57, 300881], [62, 301121], [67, 301301]]}, {"verse": 38, "start": 302475, "end": 317730, "text": "¶ And after this Joseph of Arimathaea, being a disciple of Jesus, but secretly for fear of the Jews, besought Pilate that he might take away the body of Jesus: and Pilate gave him leave. He came therefore, and took the body of Jesus.", "words": [[2, 302475], [6, 302607], [12, 302887], [17, 303107], [24, 303527], [27, 304277], [39, 305027], [45, 305267], [47, 305427], [56, 305847], [59, 306107], [66, 306787], [70, 306887], [79, 307347], [83, 307667], [88, 307967], [91, 308167], [95, 308287], [101, 309207], [110, 309647], [117, 310267], [122, 310427], [125, 310587], [131, 310767], [136, 311027], [141, 311267], [145, 31